<title>USA: Eastman Chemical Co Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Eastman Chemical Co Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSPROT, Tenn. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.77		    $1.50</p>
<p> Net			  60,000		  121,000</p>
<p> Revs		    1,113,000		1,221,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   78,200		   80,900</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $4.80		    $6.78</p>
<p> Net			 380,000		  559,000</p>
<p> Revs		    4,782,000		5,040,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   79,200		   82,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year 1996 net includes $0.10/shr gain from divestiture of unit.</p>
<p>Q4 and year 1995 net includes $0.10/shr charge for asset write-down.</p>
<p>Year 1995 net includes $0.04/shr charge for write-down of Vitamin E asset and $0.04/shr gain on sale of land.</p>
</text>
